# ⚠️ FILL THIS IN AFTER CREATING THE CURSEFORGE PROJECT, uncommented, with the
# numeric Project ID from the project's page. The packager reads it from here to
# know where to upload; without it the CurseForge step is skipped and only the
# GitHub Release is cut. Pairs with the CF_API_TOKEN repo secret (already set —
# the CurseForge token is per-ACCOUNT, so the same one serves both addons).
# See .github/workflows/release.yml for why CurseForge exists here at all.
# ## X-Curse-Project-ID: 000000

